    "label": {
      "en": "Official pension age (females): TUDef, bunct and bsa00"
    },
    "short_label": {
      "en": "$PensionAgeFemale"
    },
    "description": {
      "en": "Statutory (official) pension age for women, currently 65, used in eligibility and timing calculations across social assistance (bsa00_lt/bsa_FYA_lt Elig_Cond), unemployment benefit duration ('time left until retirement age' in bunct_lt/bunct_FYA_lt BenCalc), second-pillar pension contribution rules (tpcpi_lt/Elig) and state-insured status (tscse_admin_lt/BenCalc). The benefits document notes that reaching the statutory retirement age is an eligibility route for the single-person benefit, consistent with this constant's role."
    },
    "explanation": {
      "en": "EUROMOD function group: Pension age, MMS, AMS, AMSp,  BSA, SSI, CYI, CBN, basic/asistance pensions bases, RP"
